# SHA-256 manifest for the upstream Z3Prover/z3 4.15.7 release archives
# (W1 Slice 2, #789). download-z3.sh, download-z3.ps1, and build-z3.yml all
# verify each archive against this file before extracting. Computed
# 2026-07-31 (trust-on-first-use) from
# https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3/releases/download/z3-4.15.7/ .
# RESIDUAL RETIRED: this header previously disclosed that the ARM64-macOS path
# built Z3 from a git clone pinned to the z3-4.15.7 TAG (tags are mutable), with
# commit-pinning recorded as a follow-up under #789. That path no longer exists.
# ARM64 macOS now takes the same checksum-verified upstream archives as every
# other platform, and build-z3-from-source.sh — the only unverified fetch in the
# toolchain — has been deleted. Every archive consumed by download-z3.sh,
# download-z3.ps1 and build-z3.yml is now verified against this manifest.
# (build-z3.yml ships the same checksum-verified upstream archives as this script;
# osx-x64 is deliberately absent — upstream's x64-osx archive contains an arm64
# binary, so Intel macOS is unsupported for verification.)
# unverified input and is tracked separately.)
